<font color="#ffffff">BOYS LAUGH</font>

508
01:04:56.690 --> 01:04:59.690
<font color="#ffffff">CHAIM MUMBLES</font>

509
01:05:34.090 --> 01:05:36.730
<font color="#ffffff">I trust you enjoyed</font>
