<font color="#00ffff">they will be ready to leave.</font>

554
01:10:15.610 --> 01:10:16.690
<font color="#ffffff">I feel the same.</font>

555
01:10:19.890 --> 01:10:22.448
<font color="#00ff00">Well, what parent ever believes</font>
<font color="#00ff00">they have done enough to</font>

